    "detailed_description": "<strong>YOU THERE, GULLIBLE CONSUMER!!!</strong><br><br>Do you like platforming, slushies, grappling hooks, and other things? Then join Biboby on his journey through the bowels of a convenience store to fix a malfunctioning cash register that won't scan milk. Use the incredibly unsafe and corporate-licensed Fling-a-Thing to traverse the cavernous backrooms of the store on your journey. <br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Fling yourself in any direction through deadly levels!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Find secrets in the depths of the store!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Compete for the fastest time with your friends!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Die <i>multiple</i> times!</li></ul><br>Good luck you spunky young employee and we here at Songbird believe in you!<br>(Warning: belief is not in the Songbird company budget)",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>YOU THERE, GULLIBLE CONSUMER!!!</strong><br><br>Do you like platforming, slushies, grappling hooks, and other things? Then join Biboby on his journey through the bowels of a convenience store to fix a malfunctioning cash register that won't scan milk. Use the incredibly unsafe and corporate-licensed Fling-a-Thing to traverse the cavernous backrooms of the store on your journey. <br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Fling yourself in any direction through deadly levels!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Find secrets in the depths of the store!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Compete for the fastest time with your friends!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Die <i>multiple</i> times!</li></ul><br>Good luck you spunky young employee and we here at Songbird believe in you!<br>(Warning: belief is not in the Songbird company budget)",
    "short_description": "A unique, stylish platformer based around flinging yourself as fast as possible in any direction. Venture deep into the &quot;Songbird Short Stop&quot; to fix a cash register that won't scan milk in this exhilarating precision platformer.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
